.claude/agent-memory/
# Catch nested .claude/agent-memory/ created by sub-agents inside any
# nested module (e.g. tools/learn/.claude/agent-memory/) — the rule above
# is anchored to the repo root, so we also need the recursive glob below.
**/.claude/agent-memory/

